          <msContents>
            <summary>[p]Scroll containing remedies and charms against diseases, wounds, etc. Written in Late Middle English. Incomplete.[/p]

[p][b]Contents[/b][/p]

[p]Recto: her bygynnyth medicynys.  He [that] have tod akyng  ...  Ghyf the wonde be lokyn to gedere or hit be hol.[/p]

[p]Verso [Charm]e for the festerys [?] ... thys charm ys of Susana that seynt gebryel hirre broughte fro god for to charme men of wormys of fester of goute ... vorms that dryue and ingrowen [?] and also ... [ends imperfectly].[/p]</summary>
            <textLang mainLang="" source="IANA">English</textLang>
